      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOT MINUTE (5) is a smart dog who hit the ground running and cleared the ruck from the pinch draw to lead all the way to score (29.78) at Northam in Grade 4/5 over 509m. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Form reads well for this. NYOTA (1) produced an impressive win last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by 0.8 lengths (28.20) at this track. Capable of going close again. THUMANI (7) boasts a strong record this journey here with three wins and three minors from nine tries. Placed last time (27.76) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 6 lengths. Suited here and expected to run well. WEST ON PASH (2) racing over this distance brings the best out in her.",
